type: software
title: "bmlab (fork)"
abstract: >-
  Python library for the post-measurement analysis of Brillouin microscopy data. Modified fork of bmlab by the bmlab developers, released under the GNU General Public License v3.0. The
  modifications by Niklas Gampl are documented in the CHANGELOG and the commit history.
